<span id="A4.T4.sf1.2.1.1.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_b"><math id="A4.T4.sf1.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\texttt{dense\_size}\to\texttt{num\_classes}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">dense_size</mtext><mo stretchy="false">→</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">num_classes</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\texttt{dense\_size}\to\texttt{num\_classes}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span>
</span>
</span></span></p>
</span></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">(a) </span>CNN with GroupNorm</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
